; Without use_precise_interpolation, an interpolated number is rounded to
; the coarsest precision the transaction's numbers state: Assets:C is
; booked -7.0 USD, so the balance assertion fails.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B
2020-01-01 open Assets:C

2020-01-02 * "Interpolated to one digit"
  Assets:A  10.12345 USD
  Assets:B  -3.1 USD
  Assets:C

2020-01-03 balance Assets:C  -7.02345 USD
